  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15d0/level_act15d0_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f00376191182c8ccf792ff44c40732762f25e442466dd5465fac7880fda5e74f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "給我倒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_132",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咕，可惡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "哇啊，喂，怎麼回事啊，怎麼忽然就打起來了的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "卡夫卡，不是讓你藏好，你怎麼跑我這來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "哎呀，我沒事，你趕緊給我解釋一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，你看不就明白了，感染者和非感染者互相看不順眼不是很常見的事嗎，然後我們就分成兩派打起來囉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "雖然確實是很常見的事沒錯，但是獄警不管嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你仔細看看他們的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_134",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘖嘖，還是看這群囚犯打架有樂子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_134",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今天輪到咱們值班算是賺到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_134",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_134",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "待在這鬼地方工作唯一的樂趣也就是這種時候了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_134",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "加油啊，A區的，我看好你們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看到沒，他們才是最享受的傢伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪邊贏了接下來一段時間伙食還會好一點呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "那不是樂子全被他們找去了，不打不行嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不打？卡夫卡，你知道我怎麼進監獄的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就是因為揍了看不起我的那些人一拳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘿，卡夫卡，這座監獄可能是這片大地上唯一幹爆那群沒被感染的雜種們也不會有什麼後果的地方了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "打死了也就是關一陣子禁閉的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且真要死了那就死了，進監獄了誰怕這個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘖，不跟你說了，我繼續去幹架了，你當心點藏好啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "嘁，也太看不起我卡夫卡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "不過，感染者和非感染者之間的矛盾果然在這裡也存在啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "而且不僅存在，還變成了一種超級扭曲的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "雖然在外面也見過不少事了，但是這樣的場景我也還是第一次見到誒......要是赫默看了肯定會受不了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "不過我可就不一樣了，嘿嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "場面越混亂我越喜歡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "你們打你們的，讓我看看有沒有油水可以讓我蹭一蹭，也好給後面的事情做點準備......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "噫，誰把沒吃完的飯給偷偷帶過來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "這裡怎麼有一隻襪子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "不愧是官方的監獄，該做的還是做了的嘛，沒有什麼直接能用的東西啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "不過......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去死吧，雜碎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_132",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "該死的是你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "哦哦，真是激烈，而且，這些囚犯前輩們也真是不老實，居然偷偷做了各種奇怪的武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "你們再打得凶一點，然後掉些東西給我吧，嘿嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_451_robin#6",
      "operatorId": "char_451_robin",
      "portraitKey": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "讓我抓到個落單的，嘿嘿嘿......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "哎呀，那個女孩子有危險！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "女孩子還是要去幫一把......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_451_robin#6",
      "operatorId": "char_451_robin",
      "portraitKey": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯",
      "speakerToken": "char_451_robin#2",
      "operatorId": "char_451_robin",
      "portraitKey": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "嘿嘿......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "咦，這個女孩子好像也藏了一手的樣子，有趣有趣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_135#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼回事？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_134",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "報告巴頓隊長，囚犯們打起來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴頓",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_135#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你們還在那看著，還不讓他們停手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_134",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，隊長，到時候了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴頓",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_135#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼到時候不到時候，管理囚犯是我們獄警的職責！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_134",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好的好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_134",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，你們，隊長發話了，該停下了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯們",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*哥倫比亞俚語*"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯們",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_132",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*哥倫比亞方言*"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴頓",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_135#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，我都說過幾次了，這裡是監獄，不是你們的戰場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴頓",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_135#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們應該在這裡好好勞動，好好表現自己，這樣在外面的親朋好友們才能早日見到你們，是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴頓",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_135#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我說這些也是為了你們好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘖，又開始了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "哇，你身上不少傷啊，沒事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒事沒事，小傷，比起這個，我可是放倒了好幾個A區的雜碎呢，嘿嘿，值了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "每次都是這麼收場的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你說巴頓？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "差不多吧，他是獄警們的隊長，每次這種時候巴頓都會裝模作樣地出來制止一下，然後說一些漂亮話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "尤其現在是監獄停靠在城市的時期，典獄長是不在的，他就搞得跟自己是這座監獄的主人一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "蠢貨一個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過你說是不是每次都這樣，那也不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也有好幾次是打太起勁了收不住......倒不如說收不住了才比較正常，今天這樣說停就停才比較少見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "反正收不住的時候，巴頓一般就會搬出他的救兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "救兵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喏，來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "安東尼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看來你真的認得他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "雖然我只看過他穿正服的樣子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴頓",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_135#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們應該向安東尼先生學習。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴頓",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_135#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然身為囚犯，但卻崇尚理性，不輕易使用暴力。平時喜歡看書，寫字，聽音樂，多麼高雅！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "你不喜歡安東尼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不不不，別搞錯了，卡夫卡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這座監獄裡，沒有人不服安東尼的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他平時就像巴頓說的那樣，對別人很好，但我們都知道，他才是這座監獄裡最厲害的傢伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "據說他剛進監獄的時候可是直接把整個C區的人都給打服了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒錯，而且雖然他人在C區，一般和我們很少接觸，但是他對人真的很好，不管是A區還是B區的，對他都是服氣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對對，我嘔的是巴頓這傢伙的嘴臉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你聽聽，他那是真的在誇安東尼嗎？他那是羞辱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "安東尼是唯一讓他抬不起頭的對象，但他又必須依靠安東尼來搞定我們，於是他就只能搞這種手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴頓",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_135#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們州立曼斯菲爾德監獄，可是首都特批的試驗監獄，將來是要作為榜樣推廣給其他州的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘖，大家都是囚犯當什麼榜樣啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴頓",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_135#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "總而言之，希望你們能夠為自己想一想，也為我想一想！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴頓",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_135#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走吧，安東尼，今天你有一個小時的讀書時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "平時一般都見不到安東尼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "應該是吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們重犯的時間安排和我們不一樣，而且他們大部分時候都待在C區的塔裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼，你想見他？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "算是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "我想跟他商量一件事，當然，肯定是不能被獄警知道的那種。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放心，我懂的。你想和他說些悄悄話的話，倒也不是沒有機會......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
